{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game about dinos digging up dinos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a paleontologist trying to revitalize a decrepit museum by filling it with beautiful fossils straight out the Cretaceous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A cast of cute dinosaur (and other paleo) townsfolk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Full character customization (species, color palette, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fossil cleaning mini game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover 14 fully-realized vertebrate fossils</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Drive across a curated open world and explore environments inspired by real-world dig sites</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Uncover the geological history of the region by collecting invertebrate fossils</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find hidden content and easter eggs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capsule artwork created by SunnyHallows</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1797850?t=1771451709","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1797850?t=1771451709","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797850/b6694deeacf64bc0cae133debdb41a3a013e4f08/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771451709","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1797850/b6694deeacf64bc0cae133debdb41a3a013e4f08/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771451709","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game about dinos digging up dinos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a paleonto